{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20401",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.72,
      "end_seconds": 4.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Good morning, grab a seat. What's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.4,
      "end_seconds": 11.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Um, so... a hoarse voice. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.71,
      "end_seconds": 16.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.48,
      "end_seconds": 36.03,
      "duration_seconds": 18.55,
      "text": "Actually, for two years, I'd say. I've had a tickle at the back of my throat too, for three weeks. About tickle at the back of my throat, I'd call it mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.78,
      "end_seconds": 44.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "Okay, have you had a hoarse voice before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.19,
      "end_seconds": 51.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 52.99,
      "end_seconds": 67.24,
      "duration_seconds": 14.25,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Weight 77 kilos, height 171 centimetres. Pulse 68, BMI works out to 26.3, respiratory rate 16, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pressure 111 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.16,
      "end_seconds": 70.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.91,
      "end_seconds": 76.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.2,
      "end_seconds": 80.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "So, breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.01,
      "end_seconds": 99.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and there is no wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.0,
      "end_seconds": 105.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.99,
      "end_seconds": 118.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.28,
      "end_seconds": 122.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.94,
      "end_seconds": 128.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any fever or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.58,
      "end_seconds": 133.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "No, you know, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.48,
      "end_seconds": 137.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.48,
      "end_seconds": 139.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.15,
      "end_seconds": 144.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "So, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.9,
      "end_seconds": 150.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.34,
      "end_seconds": 170.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.37,
      "end_seconds": 176.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.12,
      "end_seconds": 179.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.88,
      "end_seconds": 184.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.8,
      "end_seconds": 188.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.22,
      "end_seconds": 193.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.08,
      "end_seconds": 197.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.42,
      "end_seconds": 202.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.33,
      "end_seconds": 207.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.55,
      "end_seconds": 211.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.65,
      "end_seconds": 228.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Right, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.87,
      "end_seconds": 232.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Yes, naproxen. I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.13,
      "end_seconds": 237.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.03,
      "end_seconds": 242.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I had my tonsils removed as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.69,
      "end_seconds": 246.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.51,
      "end_seconds": 251.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.39,
      "end_seconds": 258.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.66,
      "end_seconds": 262.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.33,
      "end_seconds": 280.64,
      "duration_seconds": 17.31,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. So where does that leave us? My working impression is a persistent dry cough without a clear cause so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.28,
      "end_seconds": 284.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.15,
      "end_seconds": 301.53,
      "duration_seconds": 15.38,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a persistent dry cough without a clear cause so far, but I'd like to confirm. A breathing test is what I'd like next, for cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.18,
      "end_seconds": 305.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.41,
      "end_seconds": 312.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "I think a chest X-ray makes sense here, for chronic cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.9,
      "end_seconds": 315.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.49,
      "end_seconds": 326.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "We will review your tablets and see whether the cough settles over a month. I'll want another look in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.94,
      "end_seconds": 327.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.38,
      "end_seconds": 332.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.48,
      "end_seconds": 335.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}